@base_url = http://localhost:8082/api/v1

### Get All Product Home
GET {{base_url}}/products/home

### Get All Product Shop 
GET {{base_url}}/products/shop?search=&category_slug=&order_type=asc&page=1&per_page=10&order_by=reguler_price&start_price=&end_price=

### Get Detail Product Home
GET {{base_url}}/products/home/41befc8d-2e23-4c63-a933-584ca4c59844


### Get All Category Home
GET {{base_url}}/categories/home


### Get All Category Shop
GET {{base_url}}/categories/shop


### Membuat index `products`
GET http://localhost:9200/products/_search?pretty=true
Content-Type: application/json
